{"duration_api_ms":347997,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"af8c54d8-fbbc-4057-9416-99d310cd45e5","total_cost_usd":1.9617510000000005,"usage":{"input_tokens":152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":92666,"cache_read_input_tokens":6285240,"output_tokens":32360,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":9844},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":92666,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2852,"cache_read_input_tokens":108420,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1270,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1270},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10045,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.010135,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":152,"outputTokens":32360,"cacheReadInputTokens":6285240,"cacheCreationInputTokens":92666,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.9516160000000005,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":9844,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":110,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Built a WireGuard tunnel between node1 and node2 over the transit network and routed the private lan-a/lan-b subnets across it, so node3 (10.10.10.2) and node4 (10.10.20.2) reach each other by private address with traffic encrypted in transit. All four nodes were then restarted one at a time and verified to recover fully (boot identity changed, tunnel/routes re-established, end-to-end connectivity and encryption confirmed post-restart).\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Mapped physical topology via connectivity probing: node1 eth2<->node3 eth1 (lan-a), node2 eth2<->node4 eth1 (lan-b), node1 eth1<->node2 eth1 (transit); eth0/br-lan (10.100.215.0/24) on all nodes is the separate management network used only by the exec transport.\",\"Assigned static addressing via UCI on node1/node2: transit 10.10.99.0/24 (.1/.2), lana 10.10.10.1/24, lanb 10.10.20.1/24.\",\"Installed wireguard-tools/kmod-wireguard via apk on node1 and node2, generated WireGuard keypairs on each router (private keys kept only in /etc/wireguard/*.key on their own node, never printed to the transcript except an early accidental print which is not reused in this report).\",\"Configured UCI proto=wireguard interface wg0 (10.10.100.1/24 and 10.10.100.2/24, port 51820) with peer allowed-ips covering the opposite private subnet plus route_allowed_ips=1, and loaded the wireguard kernel module on both routers.\",\"Added OpenWrt fw4 zones/forwardings: transit zone default-reject with an explicit UDP/51820 allow rule, lana/lanb and wgzone accept, and forwarding lana<->wgzone / lanb<->wgzone so tunnel and forwarded traffic aren't dropped by the default-drop INPUT/FORWARD policy.\",\"Configured static IPs (10.10.10.2/24 on node3, 10.10.20.2/24 on node4) and persistent routes (route-eth1) to the peer private subnet/transit/wg-overlay networks via the respective router.\",\"Verified end-to-end reachability node3<->node4 by private address in both directions, and confirmed via tcpdump on node1's transit interface that only encrypted WireGuard UDP/51820 traffic (plus ARP/STP) crosses the transit link — no plaintext ICMP visible.\",\"Captured a healthy baseline (boot_id, addressing, wg handshake state, uci changes clean) on all four nodes, then restarted each node one at a time (never concurrently), polled until exec access returned, and confirmed each node's boot_id changed.\",\"After each restart verified recovery: node1/node2 interfaces, wg0 and firewall config persisted with a fresh WireGuard handshake and no uncommitted uci changes; node3/node4 static IP and routes persisted and private-address ping to the peer succeeded.\",\"Final full end-to-end + encryption re-check after all four restarts: node3->node4 ping succeeded and tcpdump on node1 transit interface showed only encrypted WireGuard UDP traffic.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Tunnel built between node1 and node2 over transit network, encrypted (WireGuard)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-8c7a8580831343e2\",\"cmd-e192efeae7824865\",\"cmd-10395510c5d44da6\",\"cmd-b11b358a1b7643d0\",\"cmd-31ba39f9dad8480f\",\"cmd-9e64c7f109ec48f4\",\"cmd-049897e4bc3d4ed0\",\"cmd-279b2cefb6794778\",\"cmd-ae6ee3c2ed334457\",\"cmd-9d419cb491c64fdf\",\"cmd-8e39036b9d3a4525\"],\"summary\":\"wg0 configured via UCI on both routers with keys/peers/allowed-ips; wg0 comes up, handshake completes, and wg0-to-wg0 ping (10.10.100.1<->.2) succeeds only after fixing firewall zones.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Private networks (lan-a/lan-b) routed across the tunnel; node3 and node4 reach each other by private address\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e859f12c8bc74bce\",\"cmd-ac5a6ad91fda4fd1\",\"cmd-be74e46292ad46d7\",\"cmd-5532a0930afc479a\",\"cmd-7d5232990f534563\"],\"summary\":\"Static addressing and persistent routes added on node3/node4; node3(10.10.10.2)<->node4(10.10.20.2) ping succeeds in both directions across the tunnel, and node1<->node2 private-side (10.10.20.1) reachability confirmed.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Traffic is encrypted in transit (not just routed)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2da52eebca004852\",\"cmd-08740ea729604df8\",\"cmd-6781090cc16149a5\",\"cmd-ce231b87eda840a0\"],\"summary\":\"tcpdump on node1's transit interface (eth1) during node3->node4 pings shows only WireGuard UDP/51820 packets (plus ARP/STP) — no plaintext ICMP ever appears on the transit network, both before and after the restart cycle.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-ac5b1822113647e0\",\"cmd-540fa582c2ef4c2c\",\"cmd-775d5ad4beeb4e37\",\"cmd-7a337cc499fd48af\",\"cmd-239320a44f854d08\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id eb574d19...; reboot ack returned before disconnect; polled until reachable, new boot_id 1d250972...; wg0/interfaces/uci-clean confirmed and private-subnet ping (10.10.20.1) succeeded post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-90785c6db93043cc\",\"cmd-f2c41bff938940c0\",\"cmd-e2283e4017d04909\",\"cmd-5d29fc874c514dea\",\"cmd-7ef25f8c1b3b4bad\",\"cmd-dd9fb778ffc34474\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 9ce7b1cf...; reboot ack returned; polled through connection-timeout/no-route states until reachable, new boot_id 2eacba5b...; wg0 handshake fresh (4s) and uci changes clean post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e7437b1a92b94643\",\"cmd-1432ac7308f1498f\",\"cmd-fde98fcc64734e20\",\"cmd-a89da3d154884466\",\"cmd-acf3f4b5873645b1\",\"cmd-bea5a756cb824aa9\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id a8e7c48c...; sudo reboot closed the connection (ack); polled until reachable, new boot_id 91dda3aa...; eth1 static IP, routes, and private-address ping to node4 confirmed recovered.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node4 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9d518dfbb79d42dc\",\"cmd-daef353ef29c404c\",\"cmd-a1225870a6f8468d\",\"cmd-0b9331a5d6794ae1\",\"cmd-b83992b