0.10.20.2/24 on node4) and persistent routes (route-eth1) to the peer private subnet/transit/wg-overlay networks via the respective router.","Verified end-to-end reachability node3<->node4 by private address in both directions, and confirmed via tcpdump on node1's transit interface that only encrypted WireGuard UDP/51820 traffic (plus ARP/STP) crosses the transit link — no plaintext ICMP visible.","Captured a healthy baseline (boot_id, addressing, wg handshake state, uci changes clean) on all four nodes, then restarted each node one at a time (never concurrently), polled until exec access returned, and confirmed each node's boot_id changed.","After each restart verified recovery: node1/node2 interfaces, wg0 and firewall config persisted with a fresh WireGuard handshake and no uncommitted uci changes; node3/node4 static IP and routes persisted and private-address ping to the peer succeeded.","Final full end-to-end + encryption re-check after all four restarts: node3->node4 ping succeeded and tcpdump on node1 transit interface showed only encrypted WireGuard UDP traffic."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Tunnel built between node1 and node2 over transit network, encrypted (WireGuard)","command_ids":["cmd-8c7a8580831343e2","cmd-e192efeae7824865","cmd-10395510c5d44da6","cmd-b11b358a1b7643d0","cmd-31ba39f9dad8480f","cmd-9e64c7f109ec48f4","cmd-049897e4bc3d4ed0","cmd-279b2cefb6794778","cmd-ae6ee3c2ed334457","cmd-9d419cb491c64fdf","cmd-8e39036b9d3a4525"],"summary":"wg0 configured via UCI on both routers with keys/peers/allowed-ips; wg0 comes up, handshake completes, and wg0-to-wg0 ping (10.10.100.1<->.2) succeeds only after fixing firewall zones."},{"requirement":"Private networks (lan-a/lan-b) routed across the tunnel; node3 and node4 reach each other by private address","command_ids":["cmd-e859f12c8bc74bce","cmd-ac5a6ad91fda4fd1","cmd-be74e46292ad46d7","cmd-5532a0930afc479a","cmd-7d5232990f534563"],"summary":"Static addressing and persistent routes added on node3/node4; node3